    "extract": "Willebrord Jan Frans Maria \"Willy\" Vandersteen was a Belgian creator of comic books. In a career spanning 50 years, he created a large studio and published more than 1,000 comic albums in over 25 series, selling more than 200 million copies worldwide.",
    "extract_html": "<p><b>Willebrord Jan Frans Maria \"Willy\" Vandersteen</b> was a Belgian creator of comic books. In a career spanning 50 years, he created a large studio and published more than 1,000 comic albums in over 25 series, selling more than 200 million copies worldwide.</p>"
